
.subckt astra_055_mos_gilbert_balanced_mixer vdd VSS op om rfp rfn lop lon vb
CN om VSS 100f
CP op VSS 100f
M1 net1 rfp net0 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M2 net2 rfn net0 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M3 op lop net1 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 om lon net1 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 op lon net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 om lop net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M7 net0 vb VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
RN vdd om 10k
RP vdd op 10k
.ends astra_055_mos_gilbert_balanced_mixer
